000", "id": 2}, {"image": "engenn6le05ob10re2img07.jpg", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>: Yeah. You should get at least 8 hours of sleep every night. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: 8 hours? I didn't think you were that kind of guy!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Chef Bruce</span>: I work long hours. I'm too tired to party after my shift ends. I'd much rather go home and sit quietly with a book!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: You're right. I ought to read more too. You really are a man of many talents!", "time": "38000", "id": 3}]}}], "_data": []}], "_data": [{"type": "lab_options", "contents": [{"content": true, "type": "has_nav"}, {"content": true, "type": "has_exercise_controls"}]}], "id": 0}], "type": "sena"}